          "v": "x^3 - 2x^2 - 9x + 18 = 0"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Which of the following is a solution to the given equation?"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Factor the left side by grouping. Group the first two terms and the last two terms:"
        },
        {
          "t": "mathblock",
          "v": "x^2(x - 2) - 9(x - 2) = 0"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Factor out the common binomial "
        },
        {
          "t": "math",
          "v": "(x - 2)"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ":"
        },
        {
          "t": "mathblock",
          "v": "(x - 2)(x^2 - 9) = 0"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Because "
        },
        {
          "t": "math",
          "v": "x^2 - 9 = (x - 3)(x + 3)"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ", the equation factors completely as "
        },
        {
          "t": "mathblock",
          "v": "(x - 2)(x - 3)(x + 3) = 0"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Setting each factor equal to 0 gives the solutions "
        },
        {
          "t": "math",
          "v": "x = 2"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ", "
        },
        {
          "t": "math",
          "v": "x = 3"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ", and "
        },
        {
          "t": "math",
          "v": "x = -3"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". Of these, only "
        },
        {
          "t": "math",
          "v": "x = 2"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " appears among the choices. (Note that "
        },
        {
          "t": "math",
          "v": "-2"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " comes from reversing the sign of the "
        },
        {
          "t": "math",
          "v": "(x - 2)"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " factor, so it is not a solution.)"
        }
